{
  "name": "Improved Awakened Season",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The effect of your Awakened Season improves in the following ways:</p><p><strong>Spring.</strong> Affected creatures that start their turn in the area or enter it for the first time on a turn, regain hit points equal to your spellcasting ability modifier. This effect does not receive the bonus healing from Awakened Season.</p><p><strong>Summer.</strong> You add your spellcasting ability modifier to any radiant or fire damage you deal to affected creatures in the area.</p><p><strong>Autumn.</strong> You add your spellcasting ability modifier to any lightning or necrotic damage you deal to affected creatures in the area.</p><p><strong>Winter.</strong> You add your spellcasting ability modifier to any cold damage you deal to affected creatures in the area.</p>",
